01:38:48.811 --> 01:38:49.644
- [Louis] Damn.

01:38:49.644 --> 01:38:51.642
- Yeah I think we've made
it into this failure thing.

01:38:51.642 --> 01:38:52.475
Burning out's awesome.

01:38:52.475 --> 01:38:54.892
I've changed my fucking mind.

01:38:58.570 --> 01:38:59.902
- [Louis] That's moving, man.

01:38:59.902 --> 01:39:00.985
