01:40:07.781 --> 01:40:09.982
Like you follow baseball?

01:40:09.982 --> 01:40:11.388
- [Louis] Yeah, yeah, of course.

01:40:11.388 --> 01:40:12.221
Yeah, you're right.

01:40:12.221 --> 01:40:13.996
- Go buy some Bowman Rookie cards.

